<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 90,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 90,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's actual receipts 90,000 head. Opening trade was not well established.</p>
<p>Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than mid-session Wednesday. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				 Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		  52.50 -53.50	   53.50 -54.50</p>
<p>few			    52.00 -54.00	   53.00 -55.00</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	40.00 -43.00	   41.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		 42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		  46.00 -48.00	   48.00 -49.00</p>
